  "sectionNotes": {
    "U4_U5": "normal climb till the first peak (Col de la Seigne - France Italy border). Then 1 k down then leave the TMB trail to the tiny trail climb to Pyramide Calcaire (2600m). A lot of stones and rocks (careful with poles). On the downhill BE VERY CAREFUL not to twist ankle because of rocks ",
    "U11_U12": "after peak La Giete, technical down hill roots and rocks and steep around 20-25%. Especially the last part after Col de la Forclaz (water fountain). 1 km flat then very steep down hill 30+% before Trient",
    "U12_U13": "before Vallorcine technical steep downhill with roots"
